From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <daryldenson0405@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 01:40:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] zuma: use Evolution X's Pixel config overlays

vendor/pixel-style defines RRO modules with the same names as nine of
zuma's overlays (GlanceableHub*, GoogleConfigOverlay,
GooglePermissionControllerSafetyCenterOverlay, PixelConfigOverlay*), so both
cannot exist. Evolution's copies carry every value zuma's do (two translations
differ in wording) plus more. common.mk still installs them by name.
